From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] qmgr: BITS upload and upload-reply jobs (3577)

qmgr: BITS upload and upload-reply jobs, reply calls

Upload jobs (BG_JOB_TYPE_UPLOAD, _UPLOAD_REPLY) were never sent. The transfer now speaks the
BITS upload protocol (Create-Session, Fragment with Content-Range, Close-Session, Cancel-Session)
over winhttp, resends from the server's received range, and reports errors with the file's
context. Upload jobs take one http(s) file, leave the local file alone on Complete and Cancel.
GetReplyProgress, GetReplyData, SetReplyFileName and GetReplyFileName are implemented; the class
factory's LockServer answers S_OK; SetPriority and SetNotifyFlags give E_INVALIDARG for bad values.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
